---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../../components/Footer.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";
---

<Layout title="Roofing Calculators — Calculator Street" description="Roofing calculators for pitch, square footage & squares. Get ratio, angle, slope & roofing cost from building size & overhang.">
  <Header />
  <main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-6 py-6 max-md:px-4">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: "Home", href: "/" }, { label: "Construction", href: "/construction/" }, { label: "Roofing Calculators" }]} />
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[900px] pt-4">
      <h1 class="text-display-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-ink">Roofing Calculators</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">Pitch, area, squares and shingles for gable and hip roofs. Measured in rise/run, degrees and squares (100 ft²).</p>
      <ul class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2" role="list">
        <li><a href="/roof-pitch-calculator/" class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-md border border-hairline bg-canvas p-5 shadow-card hover:shadow-card-hover dark:bg-canvas"><h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Roof Pitch Calculator</h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-5 text-body">Ratio, angle & slope from rise & run</p><span class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-ink">Open →</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/roof-square-footage-calculator/" class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-md border border-hairline bg-canvas p-5 shadow-card hover:shadow-card-hover dark:bg-canvas"><h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Roof Square Footage Calculator</h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-5 text-body">Area & squares with waste and overhang</p><span class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-ink">Open →</span></a></li>
      </ul>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">
        <section class="rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas p-6 dark:bg-canvas">
          <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink">Pitch & area relationship</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">Pitch is rise over run per 12 inches. Angle = arctan(rise÷run)×180/π. Multiplier = √(pitch²+144)÷12: 4:12=1.054, 6:12=1.118, 8:12=1.202, 12:12=1.414. So a 1,200 ft² footprint at 6:12 becomes ~1,342 ft² roof. Use the <a href="/roof-pitch-calculator/" class="text-link underline">pitch tool</a> first, then the <a href="/roof-square-footage-calculator/" class="text-link underline">area tool</a> for squares.</p>
          <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-hairline"><table class="w-full text-left text-sm"><thead class="bg-canvas-soft font-mono text-[11px] text-mute"><tr><th class="px-3 py-2">PITCH</th><th class="px-3 py-2">ANGLE</th><th class="px-3 py-2">MULTIPLIER</th><th class="px-3 py-2">NOTE</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-hairline"><tr><td class="px-3 py-2">4:12</td><td class="px-3 py-2">18.4°</td><td class="px-3 py-2">1.054</td><td class="px-3 py-2">Low slope, membrane needed &lt;3:12</td></tr><tr><td class="px-3 py-2">6:12</td><td class="px-3 py-2">26.6°</td><td class="px-3 py-2">1.118</td><td class="px-3 py-2">Common US suburban</td></tr><tr><td class="px-3 py-2">8:12</td><td class="px-3 py-2">33.7°</td><td class="px-3 py-2">1.202</td><td class="px-3 py-2">Steep, snow sheds</td></tr><tr><td class="px-3 py-2">12:12</td><td class="px-3 py-2">45°</td><td class="px-3 py-2">1.414</td><td class="px-3 py-2">Very steep, safety gear</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
        </section>
        <section class="rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas p-6 dark:bg-canvas">
          <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink">Overhang, hips & waste</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">Include overhang in footprint before multiplier: (Length+2×overhang)×(Width+2×overhang)×sections. Add 10% waste for simple gable, 15% for hips/valleys/dormers. Starter, ridge and hip shingles are extra beyond field squares.</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-body">Sources: manufacturer specs (most shingles ≥2:12 with underlayment, ≥4:12 standard). Reviewed by Vipul Otari, updated Aug 2026.</p>
        </section>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas p-6 dark:bg-canvas"><h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink">Planned</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-body">Shingle bundles (3 bundles ≈ 1 square for 3-tab, varies), roofing squares cost, ridge length. Priority after impressions in Search Console.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
